        "faq_sizing": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which size should I order?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>Order the size that matches your usual shoe size. If you are between sizes, or you wear a wide fit, size up. Our <a href=\"/pages/sizing-guide\">Sizing Guide</a> walks you through measuring your foot. If you are still unsure, email us your shoe size and we will tell you which to pick.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_fit": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it fit my shoes?",
            "icon": "shoe",
            "content": "<p>It is made to sit inside everyday sneakers, work boots and most closed shoes, and is trim-to-fit so you can cut it along the printed guide lines. It is a tight fit in dress shoes and flats with a shallow footbed — if that is what you wear most, choose one of our low-profile options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Delivery times vary by item, so we don't quote a single window. You'll get a tracking link by email as soon as your order ships, and you can follow it the whole way. Shipping is free on US orders over $50.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_pre_order": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Not sure which one to order?",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "content": "<p>Email us before you order. Tell us your shoe size or what you're looking for and we'll tell you which option fits — it's much easier than guessing and sending something back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_care": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I clean it?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Hand wash in cool water with a mild detergent and air dry away from direct heat. Do not machine dry. Care details specific to this item, where they differ, are in the description above.</p>"
